    tag: 'v0.3.12',
    version: '0.3.12',
    name: null,
    body: "## Upgrade behaviour change: `tale update` now stays on your release line\n\n`tale update` (without `--version`) now targets the newest release **within your current x.y release line** — a 0.3.x instance updates to the newest 0.3.x and never crosses to a newer line on its own. When a newer line exists, the command says so and prints the exact `tale update --version <ver>` command to move deliberately. Explicit `--version` behaves as before (any version, up or down).\n\nWhy this matters now: the upcoming **0.4.0 is a breaking, fresh-deploy-only release** with no 0.3 → 0.4 upgrade path. Update your CLI to 0.3.12 **before** 0.4.0 ships, so a routine `tale update` keeps your instance safely on 0.3.x. Details: [Upgrades docs](https://github.com/tale-project/tale/blob/main/docs/en/self-hosted/operate/upgrades.md).\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): align section actions, status chips, and chart chrome by @AdeolaAdekoya in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2820\n* feat(platform): onedrive sync engine installs on first sync import by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2821\n* fix(platform): keep automations catalog bottom padding in scroll flow by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2824\n* feat(platform): auto-resync installed automation on upload replace by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2825\n* feat(platform): immediate loading feedback for desk row Start by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2826\n* fix(platform): grow editor Save/Discard hit area to 44px (#1980) by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2833\n* fix(platform): truncate long contacts Name/Email/Phone cells by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2834\n* fix(platform): mobile breadcrumb back button + sidebar/nav a11y by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2835\n* feat(platform): sibling breadcrumb switchers for automations & projects by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2836\n* feat(platform): collapse mobile composer's agent + model pickers into one by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2837\n* feat(platform): unify per-chat context menu across header and sidebar by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2838\n* fix(platform): clearer first steps when catalogs, chat, and projects are empty by @AdeolaAdekoya in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2841\n* feat(platform): undo, retry and discard outbound conversation messages by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2839\n* perf(platform): cache hashed assets, revalidate index.html by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2843\n* fix(platform): scope automations 'Browse all' navigate to its route by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2844\n* fix(platform): match asset hashes of 8+ chars, not exactly 8 by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2846\n* fix(platform): defer Sheet side border to sm+ for mobile full-bleed by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2856\n* refactor(platform): back arrow for mobile page-header control by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2850\n* refactor(platform): reroute chat browse button to agents roster by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2853\n* feat(platform): adapt inbox navigation and header on mobile by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2851\n* fix(platform): make prompt dialogs full-width on mobile by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2855\n* refactor(platform): responsive workflow minimap and panel borders by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2854\n* feat(platform): float mobile page actions in a bottom dock by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2849\n* feat(platform): agent-detail breadcrumb switcher and history label by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2852\n* refactor(platform): remove retired From template agent create item by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2862\n* test(platform): replace real addresses with placeholders in fixtures by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2860\n* fix(platform): prevent mobile input zoom on focus by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2861\n* feat(platform): searchable breadcrumb switchers and mobile parent by @Israeltheminer in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2863\n* feat(cli): pin tale update to the current release line by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2864\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.3.11...v0.3.12",
