    tag: 'v0.2.94',
    version: '0.2.94',
    name: null,
    body: "## What's Changed\n* fix(platform): stop docker:dev override leaking host-relative network vars by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2180\n* refactor(proxy): default the dev host to localhost instead of tale.local by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2184\n* fix(platform): reset editor dirty state after save by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2189\n* feat(platform): paginate the config-driven Collection block by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2193\n* fix(proxy): stop routing platform favicon + manifest to Convex dashboard by @larryro in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/2197\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.2.93...v0.2.94",
