    tag: 'v0.2.72',
    version: '0.2.72',
    name: null,
    body: '# v0.2.72 — Confidentiality notice refresh and example library cleanup\n\nA small maintenance release. The chat confidentiality footer gets clearer copy\nand a centered layout across en/de/fr, and the shipped example-agent library is\ntrimmed to the actively maintained set.\n\n## 🛠 Improvements\n- Refresh the chat confidentiality footer: shorter copy that emphasizes verifying AI responses and avoiding sensitive data, with the icon and text now centered horizontally. Strings updated in en, de, and fr.\n\n## 📝 Other\n- Remove the `file-assistant` and `web-assistant` example agents and tidy stray references in `chat-input`, `message-info-dialog`, and `tool-details-dialog` (#1704).\n\n## Upgrade\n\nNo manual migration required. Run `tale upgrade` to update the CLI, then\n`tale deploy` to apply the new version.\n\n## Contributors\n@larryro, @yannickmonney\n\n---\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.2.71...v0.2.72',
